chers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Social\ufeff media \ufeffis \ufeffone \ufeffof \ufeffthe \ufeffmajor\ufeff outcomes\ufeff of \ufeffprogressive \ufeffchanges\ufeff in \ufeffthe \ufeffworld \ufeffof \ufefftechnology.\ufeff The\ufeff various \ufeffsocial\ufeff webs \ufeffand\ufeff mobile \ufefftechnologies\ufeff have \ufeffaccelerated \ufeffthe \ufeffrate \ufeffat \ufeffwhich \ufeffinformation \ufeffsharing\ufeff is\ufeff done, \ufeffhow\ufeff relationships \ufeffdeveloped, \ufeffand\ufeff influences \ufeffare \ufeffheld. \ufeffSocial \ufeffmedia \ufeffis \ufeffincreasingly\ufeff being\ufeff used \ufeffby\ufeff the \ufeffpeople \ufeffto \ufeffhelp \ufeffand \ufeffshape \ufeffthe \ufeffworld\u2019s \ufeffevents\ufeff and \ufeffcultures \ufeffwith \ufeffthe \ufeffability \ufeffto \ufeffshare \ufeffpictures,\ufeff ideas, \ufeffevents,\ufeff etc. \ufeffFurther, \ufeffit \ufeffhas \ufefftransformed\ufeff the \ufeffway \ufeffthe \ufeffauthors \ufeffinterpret \ufefflife\ufeff and \ufeffthe \ufeffway \ufeffbusiness\ufeff is\ufeff done. \ufeffThis\ufeff article \ufeffpresents \ufeffa\ufeff decision \ufeffsystem\ufeff for \ufeffselecting \ufeffan \ufeffappropriate \ufeffsocial \ufeffmedia\ufeff platform \ufeff(such\ufeff as \ufeffFacebook\ufeff or \ufeffTwitter)\ufeff to \ufeffpost \ufeffcontent \ufeffwith \ufeffthe \ufeffobjective \ufeffto \ufeffmaximize \ufeffthe \ufeffreachability \ufeffof \ufeffthe \ufeffpost.\ufeff The\ufeff decision \ufeffis \ufeffmade \ufeffconsidering\ufeff the \ufeffdomain \ufeffor \ufeffsubject \ufeffof \ufeffthe \ufeffpost\ufeff and\ufeff retrieving\ufeff data \ufeffassociated\ufeff with \ufeffit \ufefffrom\ufeff the\ufeff web\ufeff at \ufeffregular \ufefftime\ufeff intervals.\ufeff The\ufeff retrieved\ufeff data \ufeffhas \ufeffbeen \ufefftrained \ufeffusing \ufefflogistics \ufeffand\ufeff K-NN\ufeff regression \ufeffto \ufeffclassify \ufeffa\ufeff particular \ufeffinstance \ufeffof \ufeffdata \ufeffand \ufeffidentify\ufeff the \ufeffplatform\ufeff which \ufeffcan \ufeffprovide\ufeff the \ufeffmost \ufeffreachability.\ufeff The\ufeff system\ufeff also \ufeffsuggests \ufeffkeywords \ufeffrelated \ufeffto \ufeffthe \ufefftopic \ufeffof \ufeffthe\ufeff post\ufeff which\ufeff has\ufeff been \ufeffmostly \ufeffused \ufeffin \ufeffrecent \ufefftimes.","topics":[],"score":216992,"global_rank":224148,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":35286},{"name":"abhiz123/bandit","owner":"abhiz123","html_url":"https://github.com/abhiz123/bandit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A simulation on the K-armed bandit problem","topics":[],"score":216992,"global_rank":224150,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":35287},{"name":"iOSGonzo/petsite","owner":"iOSGonzo","html_url":"https://github.com/iOSGonzo/petsite","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216992,"global_rank":224151,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":35288},{"name":"Mayst0731/python_learning_practice","owner":"Mayst0731","html_url":"https://github.com/Mayst0731/python_learning_practice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"python learning practice files.","topics":[],"score":216992,"global_rank":224163,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":35289},{"name":"LeoKuhorev/django_intro","owner":"LeoKuhorev","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoKuhorev/django_intro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216992,"global_rank":224169,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":35290},{"name":"aptaylor87/FlaskMadlibs","owner":"aptaylor87","html_url":"https://github.com/aptaylor87/FlaskMadlibs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216989,"global_rank":224185,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":35291},{"name":"ltatka/matrix_classification